%% Expired-by-time and renewal are conceptual conditions/actions, not persisted EXPIRED/RENEW values. COMPLETED in this repository belongs to SubscriptionIdempotencyKey, not StoreSubscription. Do not count conceptual nodes as database enums.
stateDiagram-v2
    state "No current eligible subscription / Derived query result" as NO_CURRENT
    state "Persisted status ACTIVE / start/end dates + plan" as ACTIVE
    state "Expired by time (derived) / status may still be ACTIVE" as EXPIRED_TIME
    state "Renew / new subscription row / Wallet transaction + idempotency record" as RENEW
    NO_CURRENT --> ACTIVE: Eligible plan + atomic wallet debit
    ACTIVE --> EXPIRED_TIME: endDate <= current time
    ACTIVE --> RENEW: Renew after active end date
    EXPIRED_TIME --> RENEW: New eligible subscription
    RENEW --> ACTIVE: Create new row
